Today is Saturday.
My morning work shift at the café is now over.
I meet Sunita and say goodbye to her.
It is very humid outside.
Today's afternoon air is very hot and sticky.
Mumbai's weather is changing rapidly now.
The heavy rains are going to start soon.
Before the monsoon, I want to buy some essential clothes.
I do not have a raincoat.
A good and large raincoat is very necessary for Mumbai's rain.
I walk to the bus stop and wait for the BEST bus.
After a while, the bus arrives and I climb inside.
Today the bus is more crowded than usual.
I pay the ticket money and stand.
The bus reaches the city's main market.
I step down from the bus.
There are many shops everywhere in the market.
People are doing a lot of shopping in preparation for the monsoon.
Now I have to find a good clothes shop.
